{{Classic Era}}

Shadow Rage Armor is the planar armor set for [[Berserker|Berserkers]]. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 1|Group 1 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]]. There does not appear to be a named mob that always drops two pieces of this armor.

